    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d373-a1">

                <pb facs="0676" n="582" xml:id="pg582"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 130.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Brown to Mr. Merrill</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Honolulu</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-07-12"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 12,
                        1887</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to notify your excellency
                    that His Majesty’s embassy and mission to Samoa and to the chiefs and people of
                    Polynesia has been unconditionally recalled.</p>
                <p>His Majesty’s commands to this effect went forward by the steamer hence for the
                    colonies on the 9th instant.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Godfrey Brown.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
